{'symbol': 'FOX', 'date': '2022-08-03 09:00:00', 'title': 'FOX CORPORATION AND VERIZON ANNOUNCE NEW MULTI-YEAR DISTRIBUTION AGREEMENT', 'text': 'NEW YORK AND LOS ANGELES , AUG. 3, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- FOX CORPORATION (NASDAQ: FOXA, FOX) TODAY ANNOUNCED THE COMPLETION OF A MULTI-YEAR RENEWAL OF ITS DISTRIBUTION AGREEMENT WITH VERIZON FOR ITS FIOS TV PLATFORM. THE AGREEMENT INCLUDES THE CONTINUED DISTRIBUTION OF THE FULL PORTFOLIO OF FOX BRANDS INCLUDING FOX NEWS MEDIA, FOX SPORTS, FOX NETWORK AND LOCAL FOX O&O TV STATIONS IN MARKETS INCLUDING NEW YORK, WASHINGTON, D.C.'}